{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "I admit, you had me fooled. I took you for a victim...": "",
  "But I guess I shouldn't feel too lonely. You manipulated everyone, from me, to the janitor, to your boss.": "",
  "And you're in trading? I can think of a few jobs out in Kamurocho you'd be better equipped for.": "",
  "H-How dare you!": "",
  "Sir... I don't know who you are, but you really saved my skin.": "",
  "Not intentionally. And if you're smart, you'll start treating your female employees with a little more respect.": "",
  "Ugh. Ughhh. More like fear... But I will!": "",
  "(Oops, that's the wrong way. I need to get a view on what's happening inside.)": "",
  "(Oops, that's the wrong way. I need to get a better view inside.)": "",
  "(How am I gonna infiltrate this place? Being on the fourth floor doesn't help.)": "",
  "Hey. What are you staring at? You don't work here, do you, sir?": "",
  "You're not gonna try anything funny, are you?": "",
  "Uh, no. My bad.": "",
  "(I should talk to him after I have a good enough disguise.)": "",
  "Shoulder cramps!? Oh no, we can't have that! I guess I'll have to help you out!": "",
  "Hehehehe...": "",
  "Wh-What are you going to do?": "",
  "(I-Is this going where I think it is?)": "",
  "(Hm, he's giving her a massage... I'd say that qualifies as sexual harassment, right?)": "",
  "(No good. I don't have a good angle on the action.)": "",
  "(They just kicked me out. No way I can get back in there now.)": "",
  "(I'll have to figure out what's going on in there some other way.)": "",
  "(All right. You can see both Iseya and Miyamoto-san's faces. I couldn't ask for better than this.)": "",
  "(Got it. I wish Miyamoto-san's face was a little clearer, but this should do the job.)": "",
  "(All right. I got a close-up of Iseya's face and Miyamoto-san looking pretty stressed out.)": "",
  "(Hmm. The subjects are kind of far, but it should work.)": "",
  "(All right! I managed to get a nice close-up.)": "",
  "(Yeah, the Pigeon's got a clear shot for sure.)": "",
  "(I need to get the shot without Iseya noticing...)": "",
  "(Good. Now I can get in. I should head over to Isetani Trading Company.)": "",
  "(Ah, there he is. I'll get changed and talk to him.)": "",
  "(...Oops, this isn't the right way. I'm suppose to go to Isetani Trading Company.)": "",
  "Hey! What are you doing taking photos!? Do you even have permission!? I'm calling the police!": "",
  "Shit! They found me!": "",
  "(This might not be strong evidence... Hm?)": "",
  "Aren't you the guy who owns Koi Bride? I saw your request.": "",
  "Yeah, there's been an incident, and I was hoping you could help me out.": "",
  "The request said something about dismemberment...": "",
  "Yeah, hope you've got a strong stomach...": "",
  "Guess you better start at the beginning.": "",
  "It'd be best if you saw for yourself. Follow me.": "",
  "Is this... sashimi? And so much of it...": "",
  "Tragic, isn't it? All of my precious carp... sliced up and served. They didn't deserve this.": "",
  "Wait, I don't understand. Like, at all.": "",
  "You're telling me. I came into work and I was greeted by this bloodbath.": "",
  "Some sort of psychopath must've snuck in here and went on a feeding frenzy. ": "",
  "You're saying this is an outside job?": "",
  "Has to be. The lock was busted and it happened after we'd closed up.": "",
  "Okay. Killing the fish is weird enough... But why go to the trouble of making sashimi out of them?": "",
  "Beats me. But you're the one I'm paying to figure out the mystery, man.": "",
  "Wait, so the job is...": "",
  "You're damn right. You gotta find the sonuvabitch who carved up all my innocent carp.": "",
  "I gotta know why. And I gotta know that they're gonna pay for it.": "",
  "Have you reported this to the police?": "",
  "You nuts? Sure, step right into my illegal underground casino, officer. No, this one's gotta stay off the books.": "",
  "Oh, right. It'll be 80,000 yen, in that case. That work for you?": "",
  "Yeah. Just find the bastard.": "",
  "All right. Then let me start by taking a look at the crime scene.": "",
  "(I think I've seen everything I'm going to find.)": "",
  "So, it seems... the killer sliced up a certain number of fish to meet a specific criteria, and then preserved his work.": "",
  "You figure anything out, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Not yet. The motive is the biggest question mark right now.": "",
  "I'll say.": "",
  "That's where I'll start. Once I can understand the why, I think we'll start to figure out the who.": "",
  "Makes about as much sense as any of this. But what's your plan?": "",
  "Like I said, this isn't an amateur's work. I'll start with some chefs in the city.": "",
  "I'll leave you to it, then. Let me know if you find anything.": "",
  "Hm? Genda-sensei?": "",
  "Rare to get a call from him.": "",
  "What can I do for you, Genda-sensei?": "",
  "Yagami. I know this is sudden, but I've got a case for you.": "",
  "Yeah? What kind of case?": "",
  "Well, I'd usually explain it myself, but the client says it's urgent.": "",
  "Her name's Taeko Nakahara-san, 'bout middle age. She's staying at a hotel in Theater Square right now.": "",
  "Huh? Right now?": "",
  "Yes, now. Why? Don't try to tell me you're too \"busy\" to turn down a paycheck.": "",
  "When it rains it pours, huh? I guess I've got time to head to the hotel, though.": "",
  "Ma'am? I'm Yagami. Sorry for the wait, I was in the middle of something.": "",
  "Oh, it's no problem. I should be the one apologizing.": "",
  "So Genda-sensei gave you my name?": "",
  "He did. He helped me out a ways back, and I could never thank him enough.": "",
  "I'm Taeko Nakahara, by the way. Pleasure to make your acquaintance!": "",
  "Well, you already know I'm Yagami I guess, but it's nice to meet you all the same. What can I do for you?": "",
  "You won't believe this, but someone ran off with my purse! Kamurocho is as rough as they say, isn't it.": "",
  "That's terrible. Did you have any valuables in it?": "",
  "My wallet was in there of course, but I'm more concerned about my ring!": "",
  "It was a small, diamond ring that my husband gave me.": "",
  "Diamond? That certainly counts as valuable.": "",
  "Indeed! And wouldn't you know it, my anniversary is this weekend, Yagami-san!": "",
  "It'd put a damper on the whole thing to not have it, wouldn't you agree? And my husband would mope the whole time.": "",
  "He's a sentimental man, you see. Always wants everything perfect. And... Oh, I apologize, I'm blabbering, aren't I?": "",
  "No, it's fine. I can see how valuable your ring is to you both, Ma'am.": "",
  "In other words, I need to get that purse back to you as soon as possible.": "",
  "Oh, that would be wonderful. Oh, and here. I sketched out the culprit for you.": "",
  "This is actually very well-drawn. This'll be a huge help.": "",
  "Good! Glad that those art classes finally amounted to something.": "",
  "And your fee, Yagami-san? I hope you'll go easy on me, being an old friend of Genda-sensei...": "",
  "O-Oh... Uh, how about 20,000, then?": "",
  "That's quite fine. I wish you the best, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Oh dear, is that the time!? I'm going to miss my Tokyo sightseeing tour if I don't hurry.": "",
  "I'll let you go then, and I'll be in touch.": "",
  "(First thing a thief usually does is sell the valuables, so that's probably a good start.)": "",
  "Whew, I'm pretty busy all of a sudden. Where to head next?": "",
  "Excuse me, sir. I'm sorry to bother you during work, but I'm a detective and I have a few questions.": "",
  "A detective? There been some trouble?": "",
  "Well, the case is an odd one... It seems someone went and turned some carp at the Koi Bride into sashimi.": "",
  "Huh? You pulling my leg?": "",
  "I wish I was, sir, but this is as real as it gets.": "",
  "Take a look at this, if you would.": "",
  "As you can tell, that pond lost a lot of fish and gained a lot of sashimi they didn't want.": "",
  "...I see. This is what's called an \"arai\" preparation technique. It's quite skillful, really.": "",
  "So it <font_kind=yakuza_italic>was</font_kind> a pro. Do you know anyone who'd be capable of this?": "",
  "Is that a yes?": "",
  "There's this guy we fired last month... Wakahara...": "",
  "Well, we took him on as an apprentice, and even though he was pretty good, he would argue with the customers.": "",
  "Eventually he punched a customer... So we fired him on the spot.": "",
  "And you think he could be the guy who did this?": "",
  "Well, I don't know that I'd go that far...": "",
  "But I do know he had money trouble, and that he was a frequent customer at Koi Bride...": "",
  "Hm. I think I'd like to talk to him. Do you have any contact information you could give me?": "",
  "...I really shouldn't. Unless you have some proof that would implicate him?": "",
  "No, not at the moment...": "",
  "Fired or not, he was a former employee here. Without any proof, I can't just give that information out.": "",
  "For one, I don't want to believe he's that far gone, and secondly, it's not my place to give it.": "",
  "I do understand.": "",
  "(Hm, kind of a dead end. I need proof, but I've got nowhere to find it...)": "",
  "Excuse me, sir. Have you bought any diamond rings from a man who looks like this sketch?": "",
  "Turns out the ring was stolen property.": "",
  "Actually, I do remember this man coming into the shop.": "",
  "Yes, just the other day. So it <font_kind=yakuza_italic>was</font_kind> stolen, huh?": "",
  "Yes. Did you buy it?": "",
  "I'm afraid I didn't. I had a hunch it was stolen, so I refused him.": "",
  "I see... Any idea where he might have gone next?": "",
  "No... But I have a feeling he'll strike again soon.": "",
  "He returned later that night to buy a knife.": "",
  "It was a chef's knife, so I didn't think anything of it at the time...": "",
  "(Wait... the purse snatcher bought a chef's knife... Hmmm.)": "",
  "(Are these cases... related?)": "",
  "Sure. How can I help?": "",
  "Huh? Seriously?": "",
  "Yeah, seriously. And it's the work of a pro. I was wondering if you might've heard anything?": "",
  "Nope, can't say that I have...": "",
  "Can't say I'm surprised. Thanks for your time, all the same.": "",
  "Excuse me. I have a few more questions about your apprentice.": "",
  "I told you, if you don't have proof, we're done here.": "",
  "But if I did have proof... You'd tell me?": "",
  "Well, sure, I'm not unreasonable.": "",
  "Would you mind taking a look at this?": "",
  "What... about it?": "",
  "Does it ring any bells?": "",
  "Nope. Not really.": "",
  "Oh. Okay then.": "",
  "(Crap, that wasn't right. Let me think about this.)": "",
  "Is the man in the sketch Wakahara-san?": "",
  "Yes, it's quite a good likeness.": "",
  "(As I thought... The purse thief and the sushi expert are the same guy.)": "",
  "Er, sorry. Sir, it turns out this man stole a purse.": "",
  "What!? You're sure?": "",
  "Yes, my other client is one of his victims.": "",
  "So his money trouble finally drove him off the edge...": "",
  "And I don't think that's all.": "",
  "There's more?": "",
  "Just the other day, Wakahara-san bought a chef's knife at a pawn shop.": "",
  "A chef's knife? What for?": "",
  "Remember what I told you about the incident at Koi Bride?": "",
  "It had to have been done by someone with some skill at handling fish, right?": "",
  "W-Wait... Do you think Wakahara bought a knife to do that?": "",
  "Sir, I do understand wanting to protect your former apprentice. But at this point...": "",
  "I think it's safe to say Wakahara-san has been on a crime spree, and I could use your cooperation.": "",
  "It's... okay. To tell you the truth...": "",
  "When I saw that sashimi arrangement, Wakahara was the first person who came to mind.": "",
  "The cut, the arrangement, the decorations... It's got his signature written all over it.": "",
  "I see. Would you happen to know how I can reach him?": "",
  "Actually, I've disposed of all his contacts. But...": "",
  "If you really want him, just wait for him at a pachinko parlor.": "",
  "He's over at Volcano in Theater Square pretty regularly.": "",
  "Volcano, got it! Thanks for your help!": "",
  "I don't have any proof that your apprentice is behind the sashimi, but...": "",
  "You do?": "",
  "(As I thought... The purse thief and the sushi master are the same guy.)": "",
  "(This is the pachinko parlor that Wakahara frequents.)": "",
  "(Wait... Him...)": "",
  "Are you Wakahara-san?": "",
  "I'm Yagami, a detective.": "",
  "A detective? What would a detective want with me?": "",
  "A purse with a diamond ring in it... A bunch of dead fish... What do these two have in common?": "",
  "C-Crap!": "",
  "*pant* *pant* Damn... How'd you know about both of those!?": "",
  "I did my homework.": "",
  "It's time to turn yourself in. And I think you're going to owe something for those fish.": "",
  "Ha! You take me for a fool? Like I'm gonna just go quietly.": "",
  "Fine. I'm not opposed to using a little force.": "",
  "Oh yeah? It's gonna take more than a little!": "",
  "So, you wanna keep resisting?": "",
  "I-I surrender! I'm good to go!": "",
  "Okay, but before that... I've got to ask. Why did you sashimi the fish?": "",
  "...To get the ring out. The fish ate it.": "",
  "Huh? Explain...": "",
  "Well I snatched the purse from that old windbag, and I was pretty shocked to find a diamond.": "",
  "So I figured I'd head to Koi Bride to try my luck... But when I got there, I tripped, and the ring went into the water.": "",
  "The stupid fish thought it was food and they swarmed it before I could even see which one ate it.": "",
  "So that explains the random number of fish you gutted...": "",
  "Yeah, I had to go through a lot of 'em before I found it...": "",
  "Wait, but why go to the trouble of making sashimi? You could have been faster about it...": "",
  "Yeah, sure, I know that...": "",
  "But when I saw all that sliced up fish in front of me, I just... couldn't help myself.": "",
  "I figured if I plated it up, at least it wouldn't go to waste...": "",
  "Wow. You make a much better chef than a criminal.": "",
  "Haha, I suppose so. I admit that it felt good to make all that sashimi...": "",
  "Well, after you do your time, you should give the chef thing another shot.": "",
  "Maybe I will. But I think I'm done with carp for a while.": "",
  "...So that's how it happened.": "",
  "Wow! Doesn't surprise me that they ate the diamond. If it's in the pond, it's fair game.": "",
  "It was a small one... Maybe if my husband had splurged a little more, they wouldn't have gone for it...": "",
  "Well, anyone want some celebratory sashimi? I guess it'd be a waste to toss it...": "",
  "Oh, I admit, it is rather inviting. And after all, a professional chef made it...": "",
  "Maybe I'll invite my husband, too. Will you be coming, Yagami-san?": "",
  "I think I'll pass. I'm officially fished out.": "",
  "They went to the trouble of plating and even decorating the sashimi. It's kind of elegant, even...": "",
  "But there's no signs of any of it being eaten? I guess it's safe to say this wasn't a hunger crime...": "",
  "It takes skill to prepare sashimi this well... This isn't the work of an amateur.": "",
  "Looks like some of them are still alive... Why did he spare them?": "",
  "If you're asking me, I've don't have the foggiest. This guy's a real piece of work.": "",
  "Maybe he got bored? Maybe he didn't need that many?": "",
  "...Guess it's too early to speculate.": "",
  "Ice... Did he have it at the ready to make sure the sashimi wouldn't spoil?": "",
  "I suppose he did...": "",
  "In that case, was the intent to serve this sashimi?": "",
  "(I knew something was fishy about these two cases... Heh.)": "",
  "Hey, you gonna tell me what's going on or just keep staring off into space?": "",
  "Think you could head down there and hear her out? Sorry this is so out of the blue.": "",
  "Hey, I actually am... You know what, fine.": "",
  "She'll be in the lobby at Hotel New Deborah, south side. Thanks, Yagami.": "",
  "(He's protecting his apprentice, like any good master would.)": "",
  "(But if he needs to see evidence... I think I can show him something that'll make him talk.)": "",
  "I do have proof that he was involved in a crime.": "",
  "(Come to think of it, did he kill every single fish?)": "",
  "(I should check out the pond.)": "",
  "(Oh look, a cat.)": "",
  "(It must know to leave the fish alone. Good kitty.)": "",
  "(I mean, it could be a coincidence, but... I should drop into a sushi store.)": "",
  "(Oh well. Maybe if I focus on that other job for a bit, something'll hit me.)": "",
  "(I'm sure Genda-sensei's client would be happy to get her issue resolved...)": "",
  "(Which means he's the same guy who bought the knife the night of the incident.)": "",
  "Please, leave me alone!": "",
  "Why!? Why can't we be together!?": "",
  "I told you, I'm not interested! Don't make me call the police!": "",
  "But why aren't you interested!? You just aren't seeing me for who I am!": "",
  "Hey, I think she's being pretty clear, man. Back off.": "",
  "Huh!? Who are you? What's she to you!?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Hehehehe...": "เฮะเฮะเฮะ...",
  "Huh? Right now?": "หา? ตอนนี้เลยเหรอคะ?",
  "You do?": "จริงเหรอครับ?"
 }
}
